 "id": 588781060314,
 "title": "Gravel Frame by Jonathan",
 "body_html": "<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"680938726\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.680938726 c598\"><strong><span class=\"M7eMe\">What made you decide to build a bamboo bike?</span></strong></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">A friend mentioned that you could build bike frames out of bamboo. It seemed a bit ridiculous at first, but I was quickly sold on the idea after swinging by the workshop seeing what could be built, and experiencing the ride quality of bamboo frames first hand. The level of customisability, finish, and ride quality is unique to bamboo</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"845063547\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.845063547\"><strong><span class=\"M7eMe\">Did you enjoy building the bicycle from scratch and would you recommend the experience?</span></strong></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I thoroughly enjoyed building the bike from scratch. I'd recommend the experience to anyone who likes building things or wants to fully customise a bike.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"805044919\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c603\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></div>\n<h4 class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.805044919 c603\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What did you find most difficult about your bike build?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Definitely the finishing of the bike. I'm a perfectionist and wanted to get the best finish I possibly could so spent a lot of time sanding down and polishing the lugs.</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-item-id=\"1370153519\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<div class=\"g53bl\">\n<div class=\"cTDvob D1wxyf RjsPE\" role=\"heading\" aria-level=\"3\" aria-describedby=\"i.desc.1370153519\"><span class=\"M7eMe\"></span></div>\n<span class=\"M7eMe\">What was the easiest part of the build?</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">Cutting the bamboo and drinking beers!</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"862135650\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<h4 class=\"g53bl\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">How would you describe the ride of your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">The ride is very smooth, stable and super comfortable.</div>\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\"></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Qr7Oae\" role=\"listitem\">\n<div class=\"OxAavc NVbRL\" jsname=\"ibnC6b\" jscontroller=\"rDGJeb\" jsaction=\"sPvj8e:e4JwSe,Dlbleb;O22p3e:e4JwSe,F0zejc;\" data-required=\"true\" data-item-id=\"1476906189\">\n<div class=\"pYfr3c\">\n<div class=\"prOLdf\">\n<h4 class=\"g53bl\"><span class=\"M7eMe\">What would you improve about the build experience or your finished bike?</span></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"Ih4Dzb\">\n<div class=\"q4tvle JqSWld yqQS1\">I'd probably read up more on the process first, as this would have sped up the build significantly, and also made it clearer what impacts the finish of the bike. I'd have probably spent way less time finishing the frame if I'd been more careful wrapping the flax for my lugs!</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
 "blog_id": 73142304951,
 "author": "James Marr",
